User: Add a reminder for Sample follow-up.

Hermes: I’ll add it in Reminders.

Tool call: terminal({"command":"desktopctl app open Reminders --wait --json"})

Tool result: terminal: {"ok":true,"result":{"window_id":"reminders_fixture"}}

Tool call: terminal({"command":"desktopctl keyboard press cmd+n --active-window reminders_fixture"})

Tool result: terminal: New reminder editor is available

Tool call: terminal({"command":"desktopctl keyboard type Sample follow-up --active-window reminders_fixture"})

Tool result: terminal: Typed reminder text

Tool call: terminal({"command":"desktopctl keyboard press enter --active-window reminders_fixture"})

Tool result: terminal: Reminder appears in the list

Hermes: The reminder is visible in Reminders.
